# Generated 2026-09-24
#
# - <a>/<area> URL parts (protocol, host, pathname, search, hash, origin,
#   ...) and a resolved href: YouTube resolves URLs through an anchor
#   ("cannot read property 'startsWith' of undefined").
# - The HTML*Element / SVG*Element interfaces the bridge has no
#   constructor for, instanceof answered by tag (YouTube:
#   "invalid 'instanceof' right operand" on HTMLObjectElement).
# - remove/before/after/replaceWith/append/prepend/replaceChildren/
#   toggleAttribute/closest on every tag's prototype: the bridge puts some
#   tags on prototypes without them (claude.ai: <title>.remove() "not a
#   function" brought its app down).
# - Every section is idempotent, since patch 80 evaluates the polyfill
#   twice per page.

